    (property "Note" "Hysteresis. The sense node sees 43k||18k = 12.7k, so 3.3 V through 1M moves it 42 mV, which is 142 mV referred to the rail. A USB rail is noisier than a battery and the trip point is only 300 mV below the working level, so this matters more here than it did on the parent" (at 106.68 80.77 90)
